Package: oompstat
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Description: CPU CORE METER
 Per-core CPU utilization breakdown showing user, nice, system, irq, and idle time.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 oote theme palettes, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
